e": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1235323823001930", "version": "0.9.1"}, "id": "2535693663612036", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1189299444271035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1235323823001930"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2535693663612036"}]}, "change_log": "v0.10.0 \u2014 Your room becomes a pottery studio.\n\nBIG CHANGES\n- Rebuilt for mixed reality. The wheel appears on the table in front of you, in passthrough, right in your own room\n- All controls now live on one shelf in front of the wheel, with tabs: Shape, Paint, Carve, Glaze & Fire, Works, Settings\n- Firing happens in place \u2014 your pot is wrapped in flames right on the wheel\n- Supports look-and-pinch in addition to Meta Quest 3 / 3S hand tracking\n\nSHAPING\n- Squeeze from outside and the clay rises taller\n- Open it from the inside with your fingers and widen it\n- Pulling up: pinch the wall and draw it up to make it thinner and taller\n- Tools: Rib (smooth), Cutter (trim the top), Trimmer (shave)\n\nPAINTING\n- Brushes bend like the real thing: stiff at the root, soft at the tip, slowly recovering when lifted\n- Paint follows the exact shape of the bristles touching the pot \u2014 press for bold, touch lightly for fine\n- Two grips: pencil grip and fist grip\n\nGLAZING\n- Pick a glaze on the shelf and it coats the whole pot \u2014 thicker at the foot, with drip streaks\n\nOTHER\n- Fully rebuilt tutorial (4 chapters, 11 steps \u2014 what to do and how, one step at a time)\n- Controller haptics and per-tool sounds\n- Left-handed mode (tools appear on the other side) and wheel height adjustment (play seated)\n- Fixed: missing photos in My Works; black backgrounds behind the firing flames", "created_date": 1795580348, "id": "1458798027321174", "version": "0.10.0", "version_code": 6, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1189299444271035", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1235323823001930"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2535693663612036"}]}, "change_log": "v0.9.1 \u2014 \u4f5c\u308b\u697d\u3057\u3055\u3092\u5927\u304d\u304f\u62e1\u5f35\u3059\u308b\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\u3010\u65b0\u6a5f\u80fd\u3011\n\u30fb\u7c98\u571f\u30b5\u30a4\u30ba: \u308d\u304f\u308d\u8107\u306e\u571f\u7bb1\u304b\u3089 \u5c0f\u30fb\u4e2d\u30fb\u5927\u30fb\u5e73 \u306e4\u7a2e\u3092\u9078\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002\u584a\u3092\u63b4\u3093\u3067\u308d\u304f\u308d\u306b\u7f6e\u304f\u3068\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u7c98\u571f\u306b\u3002\u4f5c\u308a\u304b\u3051\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3068\u304d\u306f\u3001\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u5ea6\u7f6e\u304f\u3068\u7f6e\u304d\u63db\u3048\u3067\u3059\n\u30fb\u52a0\u98fe\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb4\u7a2e: \u6adb(\u304f\u3057)\u30fb\u5370\u82b1(\u82b1/\u4e03\u5b9d/\u9ebb\u306e\u8449\u306e\u5224\u5b50)\u30fb\u98db\u3073\u304b\u3093\u306a\u30fb\u5f6b\u308a\u30d8\u30e9\u3002\u5668\u306e\u8868\u9762\u306b\u51f9\u51f8\u306e\u7d0b\u69d8\u3092\u523b\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f6b\u308a\u306f\u672c\u7269\u306e\u7c98\u571f\u3068\u540c\u3058\u3067\u3001\u6d88\u305b\u307e\u305b\u3093\n\u30fb\u624b\u3073\u306d\u308a: \u5668\u306e\u58c1\u3092\u6307\u3067\u6458\u307e\u3093\u3067\u5916\u3078\u5e83\u3052\u3089\u308c\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f(\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u3